  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Achukule Irrigation Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (kale, spinach, tomatoes, capsicum, brinjal), Beneficiaries: Small-scale farmers, Summary: The purpose of this grant is to expand Achukule&apos;s operations as a sustainable farming cooperative and ensure food security for its members, following the success of a previous capacity building grant. Activities will include drilling a borehole to ensure a steady source of water, building an office, and installing a new drip irrigation system.</narrative>
  </description>
